osto no comprobada."><mxCell edge="1" parent="1" source="external-Ven.5.1.6" target="CS.3.1" style="edgeStyle=none;html=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.4;strokeColor=#8556a2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=#8556a2;labelBackgroundColor=#f4f8fa;exitX=0.0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1.0;entryY=0.5;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=9 6;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="37.0" y="4128.15" /><mxPoint x="37.0" y="542.3" /><mxPoint x="778" y="542.3" /><mxPoint x="778" y="420.5" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell></object><object id="edge12" label="R19" tooltip="El movimiento WMS referenciaría una recepción; vínculo individual no comprobado. | E06; E09 | No se observó el movimiento de una recepción específica."><mxCell edge="1" parent="1" source="CS.3.4.2" target="CS.3.2.4" style="edgeStyle=none;html=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.4;strokeColor=#8556a2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=#8556a2;labelBackgroundColor=#f4f8fa;exitX=1.0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.0;entryY=0.5;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=9 6;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="753" y="2222.85" /><mxPoint x="922" y="2222.85" /><mxPoint x="922" y="901.9" /><mxPoint x="1263" y="901.9" /><mxPoint x="1263" y="812.0" /><mxPoint x="1317" y="812.0" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell></object><object id="edge13" label="R20" tooltip="Planificación de Despacho se relacionaría con Picking; enlace exacto pendiente. | E10; E14 | La pantalla menciona conductor; enlace exacto con despacho pendiente."><mxCell edge="1" parent="1" source="CS.3.6.7" target="CS.3.4.4" style="edgeStyle=none;html=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.4;strokeColor=#8556a2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=#8556a2;labelBackgroundColor=#f4f8fa;exitX=0.0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1.0;entryY=0.5;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=9 6;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1827" y="276